' Public image-query serving path implemented through 2026-08-26.
@startuml ArtSearch_Public_Image_Search
title ArtSearch Public Image Search

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

actor "Alpha user" as User
cloud "Cloudflare\nTLS / WAF / rate limit / CDN" as Edge #DCEEFF

package "Hosted public application" #F8FAFC {
  component "Upload-first web workbench\nHTML / CSS / JavaScript" as Frontend #E8F2FF
  component "FastAPI coordinator\nvalidation / limits / response contract" as API #E8F7EE
  component "Bounded query encoder\npinned CLIP + CSD" as Encoder #FFF4D6
}

database "Qdrant Cloud\nclip_subject + csd_style\nprefetch -> RRF -> top 100" as Qdrant #FDECEC
database "PostgreSQL\ncatalog + ranked candidates\nimpressions + graded feedback" as Postgres #E8F7EE
cloud "R2 custom domain\npublic display / thumbnail objects" as R2 #FFF8E7
cloud "Hugging Face Hub\npinned startup artifacts" as HF #DCEEFF

User --> Edge : HTTPS
Edge --> Frontend : static application
Frontend --> Edge : multipart image + opaque session key
Frontend --> Edge : Great / Good / Bad result grade
Edge --> API : POST /api/search-by-image
Edge --> API : POST /api/result-feedback
API --> Encoder : validated in-memory RGB
Encoder --> HF : cache miss at startup only
Encoder --> API : normalized 512D CLIP + 768D CSD
API --> Qdrant : two named vectors + fixed policy filter
Qdrant --> API : fused IDs + component evidence
API --> Postgres : top-100 candidates + top-10 impressions
API --> Frontend : stable top-10 JSON
Frontend --> Edge : result image requests
Edge --> R2 : CDN cache miss

note bottom of API
  The upload is discarded after inference.
  No client-selected DB query, path, vector,
  model ID, or result limit is accepted.
end note

note bottom of Encoder
  A smaller encoder cannot replace these models
  until trained into the same vector spaces and
  validated on neighbor/ranking preservation.
end note

@enduml

@startuml ArtSearch_Public_Image_Search_Sequence
title Public Image Query Sequence

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
autonumber

actor User
participant "Browser workbench" as Browser
participant "Cloudflare" as Edge
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "CLIP + CSD owner" as Encoder
database "Qdrant" as Qdrant
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
collections "R2 / CDN" as Assets

User -> Browser : choose reference artwork
Browser -> Edge : POST multipart image + session key
Edge -> Edge : TLS, WAF, body and IP policy
Edge -> API : trusted request
API -> API : byte cap, MIME/decode check, EXIF RGB
API -> DB : resolve session + start query
API -> Encoder : one decoded image
Encoder --> API : version-compatible CLIP + CSD vectors
API -> Qdrant : named-vector prefetch + top-level RRF
Qdrant --> API : ranked IDs and component ranks/scores
API -> DB : enrich metadata
API -> DB : stages + candidates + impressions + latency + versions
API --> Edge : top-10 response
Edge --> Browser : JSON
Browser -> Assets : display/thumbnail URLs
Browser --> User : stable result grid
User -> Browser : Great / Good / Bad
Browser -> Edge : feedback + query + result + session
Edge -> API : validated same-origin JSON request
API -> DB : append graded relevance event

note over API,Encoder
  Upload bytes and decoded pixels are not persisted.
end note

@enduml
